No source post text is redistributed
------------------------------------
This resource does NOT include the underlying post text. The post text is
derived from two pre-existing public Roman Urdu datasets whose redistribution
terms we do not control:
  * RUHSOLD (Rizwan, Shakeel, Karim, EMNLP 2020)
  * RU-HSD-30K (Bilal, https://github.com/Bilal4209/RU-HSD-30K)

To keep this release compliant regardless of those datasets' terms, we release
LABELS ONLY, keyed by `tweet_id` = 'ru' + md5(normalized_text)[:10]. To attach
text, obtain the two source datasets under their own terms and run
`code/rehydrate.py`, which recomputes the same identifiers and joins the labels
back to the text locally. See "Reconstructing the text" in README.md.

Any illustrative examples in `guidelines/` and `taxonomy/` are the authors' own
paraphrases, not verbatim source posts.

